name: sim.refreshDialogs
description: Refreshes CoppeliaSim's internal dialogs. Calling sim.refreshDialogs will not trigger a sim.message_eventcallback_refreshdialogs message
luaSynopsis: sim.refreshDialogs(int refreshDegree)
pythonSynopsis: sim.refreshDialogs(int refreshDegree)
inputs:
1. refreshDegree: refresh degree (0=light, 1=medium, 2=full)
outputs:
